  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Present workflows",
      "items": [
        "Ticket files land via factory-write-tickets. factory-promote opens GitHub issues from docs/tickets.",
        "Dispatcher is factory-dispatch (gh-aw lock + markdown, Copilot). agent-router and dispatch-router route by usage limits and agent preference (claude, codex, cursor); Freebuff and OpenCode are manual fallbacks. It routes; it does not implement the ticket.",
        "Lanes: factory-lane-claude, factory-lane-cursor, factory-lane-codex. Checks present: CI, scope-guard, config-guard, Security.",
        "factory-quiet-hours gates new work 22:00-09:00 Asia/Jerusalem."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Review and ship",
      "items": [
        "Merge gate (merge-gate.yml, pull_request_target on PRs into integration): 1 scope, 2 checks (includes google-style), 4 Jev judge (OpenRouter), 5 CodeRabbit (5b fallback review), 6 merge (squash auto-merge, base must be integration). Gates 4 to 6 run only when repo variable MERGE_GATE_ENABLED is true; current value: UNKNOWN.",
        "Batch loop (factory-batch, factory/LOOP.md) and factory-review-fix (max 3 rounds, then blocked:amit) still exist. Whether Bugbot still reviews the batch PR, and whether the merge queue is enabled: UNKNOWN.",
        "After merge: Vercel preview plus convex-deploy-test to ceaseless-dog-617. preview-acceptance.yml is a manual signed-in acceptance run of preview with a synthetic account (TEST Convex only).",
        "Live: release-go.yml checks the integration head (CI, scans, preview acceptance), posts one comment on the Release PR, and dispatches release.yml when Amit (Division6066) comments exactly go. release.yml still gates the release, deploys Convex prod only if convex/ changed, merges, then checks www.tempoflow.dev/api/health. Its review is Bugbot, or CodeRabbit when RELEASE_REVIEWER=coderabbit. Rollback is manual. deploy-live.yml also exists."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "Pause and failure",
      "items": [
        "FACTORY_PAUSED_ALL or FACTORY_PAUSED skips factory jobs. force=true on workflow_dispatch runs anyway, and the lane and dispatcher steps reject a bot actor.",
        "factory-failures.yml describes the failure branch: after 3 failed fixes, blocked:amit.",
        "config-guard.yml is present (same check family as scope-guard). It is named in the Checks card because a node has only three source slots."
      ]
    }
  ]
